# LaunchDek Project Rules

Self-hosted WordPress master hub for agencies — govern, configure, and automate remote client sites via Application Passwords and core REST APIs. No child plugin required on targets. PHP 7.4+, WordPress 6.0+, GPL-3.0.

See `launchdek-standards.mdc` (quality), `launchdek-compliance.mdc` (security gate), `wordpress-php.mdc` (PHP/REST/DB), `admin-assets.mdc` (JS/CSS).

## Directory Layout

```
launchdek.php                          # bootstrap + constants + requires
includes/
  class-launchdek-plugin.php           # hook orchestrator
  class-launchdek-admin.php            # menus, settings UI, assets
  class-launchdek-settings.php         # options, defaults, sanitize
  class-launchdek-installer.php        # dbDelta schema
  class-launchdek-capabilities.php     # custom caps + role guardrails
  class-launchdek-credential-vault.php # AES-256 app password encryption
  class-launchdek-audit-log.php        # immutable audit trail
  class-launchdek-{site,checklist,run}-repository.php
  class-launchdek-remote-client.php    # wp_remote_* to remote REST
  class-launchdek-connection-tester.php
  class-launchdek-payload-mapper.php   # API step execution
  class-launchdek-step-executor.php
  class-launchdek-checklist-runner.php
  class-launchdek-drift-verifier.php
  class-launchdek-drift-cron.php
  class-launchdek-webhook-dispatcher.php
  class-launchdek-templates.php
  class-launchdek-integrations.php
  class-launchdek-rest-api.php
  class-launchdek-{activator,deactivator}.php
  integrations/
    interface-launchdek-integration.php
    class-launchdek-integration-{mainwp,managewp,wp-umbrella,wp-engine,wpvibe}.php
admin/
  css/launchdek-admin.css
  js/launchdek-admin.js
  partials/launchdek-{admin,sites,checklists,automation,templates,integrations,settings}-page.php
templates/                           # built-in checklist JSON templates (17 slugs)
assets/                              # reserved for future static assets (index.php only)
languages/
uninstall.php
readme.txt
```

## Terminology

Use **Checklist** in all user-facing copy, REST paths (`/checklists`), table names (`launchdek_checklists`), PHP classes (`LAUNCHDEK_Checklist_*`), and JS (`initChecklists`, `data-launchdek-page="checklists"`). Legacy `workflow_*` identifiers exist only in DB migration and backward-compat audit/webhook reads — never in new code.

## Architecture

- Bootstrap defines constants, requires all classes, registers activation/deactivation hooks, calls `launchdek_run_plugin()`.
- `LAUNCHDEK_Plugin::run()` wires admin UI, `LAUNCHDEK_REST_API::register()`, `LAUNCHDEK_Drift_Cron::register()`.
- `LAUNCHDEK_Plugin::init()` on `init`: `LAUNCHDEK_Installer::maybe_install()`, `LAUNCHDEK_Capabilities::register()`, `LAUNCHDEK_Templates::seed_builtin()`, `LAUNCHDEK_Templates::sync_builtin()`.
- Settings: `launchdek_settings` via `LAUNCHDEK_Settings` (group `launchdek_settings_group`). Global kill switch: `enabled`.
- Custom tables via `LAUNCHDEK_Installer` (`DB_VERSION` `1.1.0`, option `launchdek_db_version`). All DB access through `*_Repository` classes. Upgrades from pre-1.1.0 rename `launchdek_workflows` → `launchdek_checklists`, `workflow_id` → `checklist_id`, and migrate legacy capability keys via `LAUNCHDEK_Capabilities::migrate_workflow_caps()`.
- Remote calls: `LAUNCHDEK_Remote_Client` (Application Password basic auth) — never store plaintext passwords outside vault.
- Checklist engine: `LAUNCHDEK_Checklist_Runner::start()` creates run → `execute_next()` / `auto_advance()` → `LAUNCHDEK_Step_Executor` → `LAUNCHDEK_Payload_Mapper` for `api` steps; `manual` steps set `awaiting_manual` until `/runs/{id}/steps/{step}/complete`. Failures trigger `LAUNCHDEK_Webhook_Dispatcher`.
- Admin UI: thin partials in `admin/partials/` with `data-launchdek-page`; JS drives CRUD via REST (`launchdekAdmin` global). Checklists use a drag-and-drop canvas builder with step config sidebar (role mapping, API payload mapper).
- Dashboard onboarding: activation redirect (`?onboarding=1`) opens a 2-step modal on the dashboard — paste plain-text SOPs → live preview → optional site connect/test → create checklist + site + first run. Dismissal persisted via `onboarding_dismissed` setting (`POST /onboarding/dismiss`, `can_view_dashboard`). Modal markup lives in `launchdek-admin-page.php`; logic in `initOnboarding()` (called from `initDashboard()`).
- Plugin-free remote architecture: targets need only WP 6.0+ with Application Passwords enabled.

## Admin Pages

Use `LAUNCHDEK_Admin::PAGE_SLUG` — never hardcode slug strings.

| Page | Slug | Partial | JS init |
|------|------|---------|---------|
| Dashboard | `PAGE_SLUG` | `launchdek-admin-page.php` | `initDashboard()` |
| Sites | `PAGE_SLUG . '-sites'` | `launchdek-sites-page.php` | `initSites()` |
| Checklists | `PAGE_SLUG . '-checklists'` | `launchdek-checklists-page.php` | `initChecklists()` |
| Automation & Audit | `PAGE_SLUG . '-automation'` | `launchdek-automation-page.php` | `initAutomation()` |
| Templates | `PAGE_SLUG . '-templates'` | `launchdek-templates-page.php` | `initTemplates()` |
| Integrations | `PAGE_SLUG . '-integrations'` | `launchdek-integrations-page.php` | `initIntegrations()` |
| Settings | `PAGE_SLUG . '-settings'` | `launchdek-settings-page.php` | Settings API form |

Menu capability: `LAUNCHDEK_Capabilities::admin_menu_capability()` (`launchdek_view_dashboard`). Settings page render checks `MANAGE_SETTINGS` even though the submenu uses the menu cap.

## REST Permission Callbacks

`LAUNCHDEK_REST_API` delegates to `can_*()` methods — always add matching callbacks for new routes:

| Callback | Capability |
|----------|------------|
| `can_view_dashboard` | `VIEW_DASHBOARD` |
| `can_manage_sites` | `MANAGE_SITES` |
| `can_edit_checklists` | `EDIT_CHECKLISTS` |
| `can_execute` | `EXECUTE_CHECKLISTS` |
| `can_view_audit` | `VIEW_AUDIT` |
| `can_manage_settings` | `MANAGE_SETTINGS` |

## Custom Capabilities

`LAUNCHDEK_Capabilities` — use `::current_user_can( $cap )` for permission checks (respects `role_permissions` settings). `manage_options` always passes. Settings UI uses `get_agency_role_presets()` (Admin/Developer/Auditor archetypes) and `get_capability_labels()` for the role-permission matrix.

| Constant | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `VIEW_DASHBOARD` | Dashboard + menu access |
| `MANAGE_SITES` | Site CRUD, connection tests |
| `EDIT_CHECKLISTS` | Checklist/template CRUD |
| `EXECUTE_CHECKLISTS` | Run control, drift verify |
| `VIEW_AUDIT` | Audit log access |
| `MANAGE_SETTINGS` | Settings page |

## REST API (`launchdek/v1`)

Registered in `LAUNCHDEK_REST_API`. Auth: `X-WP-Nonce` (`wp_rest`) + capability callbacks.

| Group | Routes |
|-------|--------|
| Dashboard | `/dashboard/stats`, `/connections/ticker`, `/logs/feed`, `/onboarding/dismiss` |
| Sites | `/sites`, `/sites/{id}`, `/sites/{id}/test`, `/sites/test`, `/sites/tags` |
| Checklists | `/checklists`, `/checklists/{id}`, `/checklists/import`, `/checklists/{id}/export`, `/checklists/{id}/validate-step` |
| Runs | `/runs/batch`, `/runs`, `/runs/{id}`, `/runs/{id}/next`, `/runs/{id}/auto`, `/runs/{id}/steps/{step}/complete` |
| Audit/Drift | `/audit/meta`, `/audit`, `/drift/status`, `/drift/verify`, `/drift/verify/{id}` |
| Templates | `/templates`, `/templates/vault`, `/templates/{slug}/clone` |
| Integrations | `/integrations`, `/integrations/{slug}/push`, `/integrations/telemetry-rules` |

## Database Tables

`{prefix}launchdek_sites`, `launchdek_site_tags`, `launchdek_checklists`, `launchdek_runs`, `launchdek_run_steps`, `launchdek_audit_log`, `launchdek_connection_events`. Bump `LAUNCHDEK_Installer::DB_VERSION` for schema changes.

## Built-in Templates

17 JSON files in `templates/` (one slug per file). Each file requires `title`, `description`, `category`, `steps[]`, and `is_template: true`. Categories from `LAUNCHDEK_Templates::get_categories()`:

| Category slug | Templates |
|---------------|-----------|
| `security` | `security-hardening`, `security-audit` |
| `launch` | `go-live-checklist`, `migration-checklist`, `client-onboarding` |
| `performance` | `performance-baseline`, `caching-setup` |
| `seo` | `seo-setup`, `local-seo-setup`, `analytics-tracking` |
| `ecommerce` | `woocommerce-launch`, `woocommerce-optimization` |
| `maintenance` | `monthly-maintenance`, `backup-verification`, `safe-update-routine` |
| `compliance` | `gdpr-compliance`, `accessibility-basics` |

`LAUNCHDEK_Templates::seed_builtin()` runs once (`launchdek_templates_seeded` option). `sync_builtin()` on every init adds any new JSON slugs missing from the DB. `/templates` GET returns `{ builtin, categories, stored }`.

## Integrations

Implement `LAUNCHDEK_Integration_Interface` in `includes/integrations/`, register in `LAUNCHDEK_Integrations::get_all()`. Current: MainWP, ManageWP, WP Umbrella, WP Engine, WPvibe. Display names use `* Connector` suffix (translatable).

Integrations admin page (`launchdek-integrations-page.php`) has two sections:
- **Platform Connectors Hub** — connector list with Connected/Not Detected badge + Setup modal (Push Agent, docs link).
- **Telemetry Sync Mapping Rules** — table of platform → LaunchDek field mappings; enabled state saved via REST.

`LAUNCHDEK_Integrations` helpers: `get_statuses()`, `get_launchdek_fields()`, `get_default_telemetry_rules()`, `get_telemetry_rules()`, `save_telemetry_rules()`. Rules persist in `launchdek_settings.telemetry_sync_rules` (id + enabled only; defaults are code-defined).

Integration REST routes require `MANAGE_SETTINGS` (`can_manage_settings`).

## Naming

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Constants | `LAUNCHDEK_*` | `LAUNCHDEK_VERSION`, `LAUNCHDEK_REST_NAMESPACE` |
| Classes | `LAUNCHDEK_{Name}` | `LAUNCHDEK_Site_Repository` |
| Functions | `launchdek_{action}` | `launchdek_run_plugin()` |
| Options | `launchdek_{key}` | `launchdek_settings`, `launchdek_db_version` |
| CSS/JS handles | `launchdek-{name}` | `launchdek-admin` |
| CSS classes | `launchdek-*` | `launchdek-card`, `launchdek-stats-grid` |
| JS global | `launchdekAdmin` | REST URL, nonce, strings |
| Cron hook | `launchdek_drift_verify_cron` | twicedaily drift checks |

`LAUNCHDEK_TEXT_DOMAIN` must match `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_SLUG` (`launchdek`).

## Extension Hooks

- `launchdek_settings_defaults`, `launchdek_settings_sanitize`

## Scope & Change Discipline

- Minimize diff scope; match existing class-based layout.
- Add `index.php` silence files when creating new directories.
- Update `readme.txt` changelog for user-facing changes.
- New repositories/integrations follow existing `class-launchdek-*` naming.

## Constants (use, don't redefine)

`LAUNCHDEK_VERSION`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_FILE`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_DIR`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_URL`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_BASENAME`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_SLUG`, `LAUNCHDEK_TEXT_DOMAIN`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_DOCS_URL`, `LAUNCHDEK_REST_NAMESPACE`
